cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Greek Corpus Pipeline
message: If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Anonymous authors (withheld for double-blind review)
version: 3.1.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Free desktop application for the diagnosis, assisted correction, search and
  statistics of Ancient Greek treebanks in AGDT format. Seventy-seven
  diagnostic checks classified on two axes - what kind of finding it is, and
  what can be done with it - with the original never modified.
keywords:
  - ancient greek
  - treebank
  - AGDT
  - annotation error detection
  - digital classics
  - corpus linguistics
